    "statement": "For the active blocks of any nonzero trade in a prize-row uniform minimal Maxwell core, pairwise block intersections force at least th-t(t-2)a points private within the active subfamily. Minimal-core privacy and bounded host absorption imply a>=ceil((h+1)/(2(L-2))). Hence the complete uniform P-A branch is empty through selector ranks 11243370,9629972,2241633 at rates 1/4,1/8,1/16, independent of trade rank. High-rank uniform and all nonuniform cells remain open."
